messages[7]{user,text}:
  user_2,Hi is this Reyansh Tiwari from DCoders
  user_1,Yeah that's me
  user_2,Hi Reyansh good afternoon My name is Suresh Deshmukh and I'm calling from Secure Life Solutions I'm your insurance agent for your auto policy
  user_1,Hi Suresh
  user_2,Reyansh I'm calling to inform you that your auto policy is up for renewal It's been a year since you purchased the policy
  user_1,Oh okay I wasn't aware of that
  user_2,Don't worry it's an automated process I just need to confirm a few details with you to renew the policy But I noticed that you haven't made any payments for the past two months
  user_1,Yeah I've been meaning to get to that
  user_2,I understand that unforeseen circumstances can arise However since you've missed two payments your policy has been cancelled and is now expired
  user_1,What That's not what I wanted to hear
  user_2,I apologize for the inconvenience Reyansh If you'd like to reinstate your policy we can discuss the options available to you